# Whitelist: only this project's own docs, tools and sandbox scripts are tracked.
# The game itself (installer, paks, extracted files), dumps, logs and the player's save never go into git.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
# notes/ (research notes, blog, change log) stays local
!tools/
!tools/*.py
!vm/
!vm/*.ps1
!vm/*.cmd
!vm/*.sh
!vm/*.wsb
!vm/DebugConfig.cfg
!host/
!host/*.c
!host/*.cmd
